{"full":"hf:ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA","spaceId":"ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA","name":"Qwen-Image 2.1 Doodle-In LoRA","source":"huggingface","description":"Scribble an outline on a photo, name it, it appears","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","lora","qwen-image","image-to-image","inpainting","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":4,"created":"2026-09-27T17:14:05.000Z","updated":"2026-09-29T13:29:45.000Z","license":"other","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://ml-intern-lab-qwen-image-2-1-doodle-in-lora.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.034Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.034Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.034Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"✏️","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Demo for ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA, an edit LoRA for Qwen-Image 2.1 trained by ML Intern on ML-Intern-lab/doodle-in-pairs: real Open Images photos as targets, the same photos with one object removed by LaMa and a magenta scribble drawn in its place as inputs.","Draw an outline in magenta on a photo, type what it is, and the model draws that object into the scribble. The prompt sent to the model is Turn the magenta scribble into {caption}. Strokes are redrawn at the training width (5 px at a 768 px short side) before inference, so the brush size does not matter.","Example photos are from Open Images V7 (CC BY 2.0), modified; credits are in the app. Qwen-Image 2.1 and both LoRAs are under the Qwen Research License (non-commercial research use). Built with Qwen."],"features":["Turbo stacks the Viggle 6-step LoRA (sigmas [1.0, 0.9375, 0.875, 0.75, 0.5, 0.25], no CFG). Quality uses the base 40-step schedule.","Defaults to checkpoint 500, which won the model card's checkpoint selection; 1000, 1500 and 2000 are available for comparison.","On the card's 160 held-out pairs, checkpoint 500 + turbo scored the best object hit rate of six configurations (67.5%, 4.7 s/edit on an A100).","A checkbox runs the base model with a plain instruction on the same seed, which is the evaluation's baseline."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1632141ee0b13c05adf692f0e55b6e3a9d47c274eef10cce536afd1bfb5cdc8f","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.063Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.063Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Demo for ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA, an edit LoRA for Qwen-Image 2.1 trained by ML Intern on ML-Intern-lab/doodle-in-pairs: real Open Images photos as targets, the same photos with one object removed by LaMa and a magenta scribble drawn in its place as inputs.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1632141ee0b13c05adf692f0e55b6e3a9d47c274eef10cce536afd1bfb5cdc8f","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.063Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T13:29:45.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ML-Intern-lab/Qwen-Image-2.1-doodle-in-LoRA/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:41:17.063Z","hash":"1632141ee0b13c05adf692f0e55b6e3a9d47c274eef10cce536afd1bfb5cdc8f","originalBytes":2093,"storedBytes":2093,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["lora","ml-intern-lab","model","qwen-image","checkpoint","magenta","object","photos","scribble","base","card","doodle-in","doodle-in-pairs","edit","images","license","open","outline","photo","qwen","qwen-image-2.1-doodle-in-lora","research","same","sdk","short","step","turbo","version","viggle","which","a100","app","app.","app.py","appears","avail